SUMMARY:JPEGMAFIA
LOCATION:Roadrunner\, 89 Guest St\, Boston\, MA 02135
DESCRIPTION:with with redveil & matt proxy\nJPEGMAFIA (Barrington DeVaughn 
 Hendricks\, "Peggy") is a multi-talented experimental rapper\, producer\, 
 performer and leader in the underground rap scene. After producing six tra
 cks on Kanye West’s latest album and a very successful 2023 with “SCAR
 ING THE HOES!” JPEGMAFIA returns with a new album – title TBD – and 
 headline tour named LAY DOWN MY LIFE.\nhttps://www.axs.com/events/1408902/
 jpegmafia-tickets\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.axs.com/events/1408902/jpegmafia-tickets
END:VEVENT
