DTSTAMP:20261011T010050Z
DTSTART:20261111T010000Z
DTEND:20261111T030000Z
SUMMARY:Geese
LOCATION:Roadrunner\, 89 Guest St\, Boston\, MA 02135
DESCRIPTION:with Gwenifer Raymond\nRipping up the expected blueprint Geese 
 set with their 2021 debut Projector and the cowboy rock follow-up of 2023
 ’s 3D Country\, Getting Killed puts the very idea of conventional rock s
 tructures in the band’s crosshairs. Working at a feverish clip with reno
 wned producer Kenneth Blume over a month-long stretch\, Geese emerged wiel
 ding a sharp\, novel new vision for the genre\, sporting wry smiles and a 
 resolute confidence. The album was crowned the number one album of the yea
 r on numerous Best of 2025 lists including TIME\, The New Yorker\, The New
  York Times and more. The band began 2026 right where they left off\, with
  an unwieldy\, vexing SNL debut\, a surprisingly intimate Tiny Desk concer
 t and winning a BRIT Award for International Group of the Year.\nhttps://w
 ww.axs.com/events/1414925/geese-tickets\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://push
 pin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.axs.com/events/1414925/geese-tickets
END:VEVENT
